# Accepted container-image findings for `make image-scan` / the CI
# image-scan job (trivy, HIGH/CRITICAL, fixable only). One entry per
# line: the vulnerability id, then a comment with the justification and
# the date; remove the entry once the base image or module ships the fix.
#
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # <package>: why it does not apply / mitigation; reviewed YYYY-MM-DD
